{"version":1,"content":"<p>Adobe正在進一步擴大旗下創意軟件對Windows on Arm平台的支持。隨着InDesign和InCopy推出原生ARM64版本，使用高通驍龍X系列處理器的Windows電腦將能夠直接運行這兩款專業排版軟件，不再需要依賴傳統的x86模擬環境。與此同時，Adobe還在與微軟和英偉達合作，將更多人工智能和創意處理能力帶到新一代Windows設備上。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585972.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:20:08.792112+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":181,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:07:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T15:13:28.361100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:13:28.361100+00:00","content_hash":"e260fba18daa222124f57772a3157e150b2752a7e01da36779d00a94f600c904","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}